The provided source code defines a class `Solution` with a single method `finalPrices`. This method takes a list of integers representing prices and returns a new list where each element at index `i` represents the price after applying a discount. The discount is the first subsequent price that is less than or equal to the current price. If no such price exists, the original price is retained. The last element of the input list is always appended to the result without any discount.

