The `FileDialog` class provides a graphical interface for selecting files or directories. It supports opening files, saving files, and browsing directories. The dialog consists of two main panels: a left tree panel and a right content panel. The left panel displays a hierarchical view of directories and bookmarks, while the right panel shows details about the selected items.

