- **degrees**: A tuple of integers representing the degrees of the numerator polynomial \( P(x) \) and the denominator polynomial \( Q(x) \). Default is `(5, 4)`.
- **cuda**: A boolean indicating whether to execute operations on a CUDA device. Currently, this parameter is ignored, and CUDA devices are used when possible.
