### Overview
This Django REST framework application provides a simple API for managing products and categories. It includes endpoints to retrieve the latest products, details of a specific product, details of a specific category, and search for products based on a query string.

### Classes

#### `LatestProductsList`
**Purpose**: This class-based view returns a list of the latest four products.

